WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.047 --> 00:00:25.629
Tom followed Dirk into the Royal Bedroom.

2
00:00:25.635 --> 00:00:28.296
The queen glared at Dirk.

3
00:00:28.296 --> 00:00:31.727
He was still wet.

4
00:00:31.727 --> 00:00:36.721
"This isn't bath day," the queen said.

5
00:00:36.721 --> 00:00:40.851
"I . . . ," Dirk tried to explain. "Well—"

6
00:00:40.851 --> 00:00:44.376
"Never mind." The king looked at Tom.

7
00:00:44.376 --> 00:00:47.482
"Wizard, I can't sleep at night."

8
00:00:47.482 --> 00:00:50.455
The queen sighed.

9
00:00:50.455 --> 00:00:53.440
"The king keeps me awake too.

10
00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:56.392
He needs a magic spell."

11
00:00:56.392 --> 00:00:58.773
Tom stepped forward.

12
00:00:58.773 --> 00:01:00.820
Dirk stuck out his foot.

13
00:01:00.820 --> 00:01:02.947
And Tom tripped!

14
00:01:02.947 --> 00:01:06.383
"Oops!" Tom said.

15
00:01:06.383 --> 00:01:08.992
Dirk grinned.

16
00:01:08.992 --> 00:01:12.181
"I have an idea, Your Majesties!"

17
00:01:12.181 --> 00:01:14.451
Everyone looked at him.

18
00:01:14.451 --> 00:01:17.349
Dirk had an evil smile.

19
00:01:17.349 --> 00:01:21.431
"Tom is a wonderful wizard," he said.

20
00:01:21.432 --> 00:01:23.837
"He can make a magic drink.

21
00:01:23.837 --> 00:01:28.063
A drink to help the king sleep!"

22
00:01:28.063 --> 00:01:31.285
Everyone looked at Tom.

23
00:01:31.285 --> 00:01:33.943
"Do it!" the king ordered.

24
00:01:33.943 --> 00:01:35.646
Tom bowed.

25
00:01:35.646 --> 00:01:41.132
"Um . . . Yes, Your Majesty."

26
00:01:41.132 --> 00:01:43.203
Tom bit his lip.

27
00:01:43.203 --> 00:01:47.954
Everyone was watching him!

28
00:01:47.954 --> 00:01:53.446
Inside his pocket Cat purred softly.

29
00:01:53.446 --> 00:01:57.353
"Just try a spell," she said.

30
00:01:57.353 --> 00:01:59.507
Tom lifted his wand.

31
00:01:59.507 --> 00:02:04.839
He cleared his throat. "King, do not weep.

32
00:02:04.839 --> 00:02:07.538
You'll soon have your sleep!"

33
00:02:07.538 --> 00:02:09.436
Poof!

34
00:02:09.436 --> 00:02:14.042
"Oh no!" The queen gasped.

35
00:02:14.042 --> 00:02:17.476
"I'm not asleep!" the king yelled.

36
00:02:17.476 --> 00:02:26.804
Tom blinked in surprise.

37
00:02:26.804 --> 00:02:33.665
There were dozens of sheep!
